  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the pork belly.
  - Slice the chicken liver.
  - Slice the kikiam.
  - Mince the garlic.
  - Slice the onion.
  - Slice the cabbage.
  - Slice the carrots.
  - Slice the bell peppers.
  - Slice the celery.
  - Turn the stove to medium heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove.
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil.
  - Add the pork belly to the wok.
  - Add the chicken liver.
  - Add the kikiam.
  - Add the shrimp.
  - "Saut\xE9 until translucent."
  - Add thed garlic.
  - Add the onion.
  - "Saut\xE9 until translucent."
  - Add the carrots.
  - Add the cabbage.
  - Add the bell peppers.
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula."
  - Add the chicken broth.
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy sauce.
  - Add 1/4 cup of oyster sauce.
  - Add 1 tbsp of fish sauce.
  - Put the lid on the wok to simmer.
  - Add 1/8 tsp of pepper.
  - Add the pancit canton noodles.
  - Stir using the spatula.
  - Add the chopped celery into the wok.
